### 企业知识助手 — 本地 Demo（需先启动 backend API）

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8001

### 1. 上传文档
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/knowledge/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=Boundary

--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="platform_intro.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

< ./sample_docs/platform_intro.md
--Boundary--

### 2. 知识问答
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/knowledge/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "demo-http",
  "question": "Agent 如何检索企业知识？"
}
